// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1674318759" "What does Crey want with my identification?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P848509935" "I'm not sure I entirely trust you guys."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1634505502" "Why should I give my papers to you?  What are you going to do with them?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1941049315" "I'm not sure I want to be giving you that kind of information."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1140703288" "You want what?  Why?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P538126430" "You're not the boss of me.  I'm not giving you anything."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
