// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2238209154" "I knew it!  There's something about you guys!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1827559994" "I'm out of here!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2432044327" "You'll be getting a call from my lawyer!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_CREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
