// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_CREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1706048663" "I'm not asking again."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_CREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2267121122" "If I have to ask a second time, you'll be joining me in a detention facility."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_CREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2196766273" "To safety...citizen!  I'll take care of this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_CREY_ALERT_TEXT :
