// NERVA_PRIMEVA_FIELDRESEARCH_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2774458458" "I'm scanning it now.  Is the base computer getting the data?"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_FIELDRESEARCH_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
