// NERVA_PRIMEVA_FIELDRESEARCH_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2986849456" "Okay, so now we have unfriendlies and see this?  This is my gun.  I'm having to use my gun!  You should have taken care of them already!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_FIELDRESEARCH_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1474585201" "What do we pay you security guys for if you don't keep away the intruders?!"

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_FIELDRESEARCH_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
