// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOIDS_D6_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1713505290" "Don't move or I'll shoot one of those freaky limbs off.  Trust me, I'd be glad to."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOIDS_D6_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4294663419" "I'm already creeped out by you, so if you want to keep all your bits in tact, you'd do well to play statue."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOIDS_D6_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3984566940" "Forget the thing!  Get the intruder!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOIDS_D6_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3744427786" "We'll re-capture it later!  Get the intruder!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOIDS_D6_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P293613445" "I just found a brand new target."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4192606505" "Shh.  Keep it down.  Okay so we have our orders.  Help round up Arachnoids."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1417534295" "How many of these 'things' do we need to capture?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3442241461" "I've been on detainment duty all morning.  They just keep coming.  I have no idea how many of these things there are."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3083798610" "Some experiment.  They're mutants.  But, wow, are they strong."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P804338211" "Have you seen those things?  They're horrifying.  Talk about giving the Gutter it's name."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4085869837" "I'm going to remove you from the equation."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P308033541" "If at first you don't succeed, go back and reload the gun."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3699709943" "I'm not feeling violent, I'm feeling creative with weapons."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P439054680" "There are few problems that can't be solve with plenty of fire power."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2575401381" "Got it."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2879275415" "I see."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2917888649" "Really?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1309512354" "That's interesting."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2020341496" "Huh..."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3730353228" "Ok."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P320272764" "Right."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1061574497" "Take them out!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1842403194" "Clean this mess up!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CONVERSE_D5_TALKER_B_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2952739778" "I just want to hurt you.  Is that so wrong?"





// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_CREYOPERATIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1581953157" "So give me what you have.  What do I need to pass on?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_CREYOPERATIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2825806947" "Shh.  Quiet down.  Someone will overhear."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_CREYOPERATIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2984201090" "I got the information.  It'll cost, as usual."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_CREYOPERATIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P394790984" "Do you have payment?  I have the intel."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_CREYOPERATIVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P334431597" "Yes, I've got thte documentation right here.  Shhh..."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_CREYOPERATIVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3779859223" "We're spotted!  Clean the slate!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_CREYOPERATIVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2235308546" "I can't be seen with you.  Clean this up!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_CREYOPERATIVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1914219181" "Let's go!  Wipe the slate!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_ARACHNOSINFORMANT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P57216396" "Discretion is the key here.  Power Tanks should only be used for abuctions."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_ARACHNOSINFORMANT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3171759882" "You're working for Arachnos.  Keep it clean and tight."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_ARACHNOSINFORMANT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1853062597" "I see you have some new personnel.  I think we can make use of them."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_ARACHNOSINFORMANT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3546195619" "This is going to be a very beneficial partnership."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_ARACHNOSINFORMANT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P397966510" "Work together and clean this up!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_ARACHNOSINFORMANT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2516395990" "All things being equal, you lose!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INFORMANT_D5_ARACHNOSINFORMANT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2762574745" "Erase the problem!"





// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D1_NPCTALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1520151102" "It looks pretty bad down there.  You Crey are going to keep us covered, right?  I didn't sign on for bloodshed."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D1_NPCTALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1222534791" "That place is a warzone.  You're going to keep us safe, right?"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D1_NPCTALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4132777206" "I see plenty of danger, I hope you're going to keep us safe.  I'm a scientist, not a warrior."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D1_NPCTALKERA_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2470194992" "I quit!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D1_NPCTALKERA_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1892501454" "What did I tell you?  You're not keeping me safe!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D1_NPCTALKERA_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2907196931" "This is insane!  I did not sign on for this!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D1_NPCTALKERA_FLEE_TEXT :
"P480445718" "What the-?  This is crazy!  I'm going back to the lab!"


// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D3_NPCTALKERA_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1332782650" " I really quit!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D3_NPCTALKERA_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1882641094" "I just bought this lab coat!  I'm not ruining it now!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D3_NPCTALKERA_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1808600795" "You are all crazy!  This is totally illogical!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SCIENTISTSDISCUSS_D3_NPCTALKERA_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3842186681" "There is no scientific data that proves violence is the-  You almost hit me!  I quit!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2195600166" "Yep.  Saw it.  I took a note of it."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3476095712" "I'm taking names.  Nothing is getting past me."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P52212393" "Don't worry.  I'm on top of it."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1920872594" "Hm...interesting."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2910498072" "Too late to move along now, isn't it?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P541279280" "You're already spotted.  Prepare for a fight."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3457491749" "I already see you.  Don't run off now."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P648651146" "You're in trouble now."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCOUTS_D5_SCRIBBLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2070742486" "Don't wander off.  The fight is just beginning."



// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P871800316" "I'll set up a series of demonstrations in twenty-minute intervals.  We should be able to get through it all in a day or two."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2335088822" "Sure.  We can check that place out later if you want."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1275141460" "I'm on shift for another few hours.  After that we'll head over to the D."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3521847998" "I'm signed on for the first demo.  It should take an hour or two."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3278569211" "We'll talk about this later!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3208750522" "I thought you guys said this area was secure!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1824355953" "Let's go, people!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P638422271" "Time to go to work!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_CREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4210125113" "Leave no trace!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1251642804" "That is true."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2066155096" "Of course."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3266145616" "Sounds good to me."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2411810822" "Protect the data!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2510177923" "Intruder!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3940254549" "Jump in Crey!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_TALKER_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1828794093" "Let's do this!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3073478168" "I'm heading over to Pocket D later.  Wanna join me?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4126531888" "It's a fairly lengthy process.  I figure we'll be on site for a while."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1737915583" "We need to schedule a few sessions for training.  Do you want to take one of them?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4054080786" "You take the first session, I'll take the next.  Then we'll switch up and do the next lecture."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_A_FLEE_TEXT :
"P613950817" "Go!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_A_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2775442681" "Run!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_A_FLEE_TEXT :
"P923216948" "Run!  NOW!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P855422421" "Sure, that sounds like a plan."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2433193741" "I'll get on it."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_B_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P801847871" "Sounds good."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_B_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3569076016" "I'm gone!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CONVERSE_D9_TALKER_B_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1733036142" "Make a run for it!"





// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P295669361" "We need to step up on PR."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P286658644" "We're in the news again."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1479861089" "Interesting..."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P859127427" "I thought Arachnos said this area was secure!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3392737227" "Area not secure!  Keep them away from all sensitive data!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2291755749" "The data must not be stolen!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3614901297" "Just because I don't care doesn't mean I don't understand."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P945430386" "Power corrupts, but absolute power is kinda neat."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P732344203" "There are some breach problems down here.  Looks like an excellent opportunity for some brute force."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1776899210" "This calls for a particularly subtle blend of psychology and brute force."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2466868048" "There are few problems that can't be solved with a lot of fire power."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P833129745" "No, I'm not feeling violent.  I'm feeling creative with weapons."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P889397791" "If you can hear me, you are in range."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P926927327" "There is no I in team, but there is a ME."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1462524608" "I'm just saying, my idea of an agreeable person is someone who agrees with me."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1920775369" "Let me finish my coffee and then we'll head over to the lab."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P904284087" "I have ten more minutes.  Let me finish my coffee then I'm all yours."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2081702574" "If you're feeling good, don't worry.  I'll fix it!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3750991628" "I'm extraordinarily patient, provided I get my own way in the end."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1351992126" "You're ready for us?  Okay, I'll send over a few guys."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1921159240" "Right.  On our way."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1316922043" "We're just finishing up break.  We'll be right over."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1191920106" "Got it.  We're on it.  Guys, keep an eye out.  Some unauthorized access going on."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3353470929" "We got intruders!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3274500622" "Duty calls.  Over and out."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P158969009" "We're on it!"



// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2506272472" "There's a lot of activity down below.  Just keep an eye out and make sure no one gets down there."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P647452023" "I'll take the second shift down below.  You can do your training session in a few hours."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1998712892" "Keep an eye out.  There've been a few breaches lately."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1916660419" "Watch out!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3569583464" "Over there!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2234834543" "I see someone!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P200302738" "Hang on!  We got company!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1824172603" "I could have sworn I asked for decaf."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4112688409" "Great.  Ten more minutes, then I'm back on shift."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1759124198" "This is cold."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4251016030" "Break time's over!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P762589960" "Hey, you're not allowed to be in here!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P61136462" "How did you get in here?  This area is secure!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P921853605" "You're not supposed to be in here!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1821374847" "I didn't say it was your fault.  I said I was going to blame you.  Hang on.  We got orders coming in."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P436000880" "I see groups here or there.  Don't worry, we'll jump on them the second we spot one."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4164859216" "We're on it.  My team is on post."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2104845604" "Defeat is my way of telling you not to be such a wise guy!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3097015293" "Don't run, you'll just die tired."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3288806850" "You're going down!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2201454753" "This is the last time I'm gonna tell you.  It's interdimensional.  Yes, she's dead but she's not when she's there."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2684423571" "I'll head on over after work.  It should be fun."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2041064674" "Don't let me forget.  We have a meeting with some Arachnos later.  I have some schedules to pass on."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2462835251" "We'll talk later!  Take care of this!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1357868489" "How did they get in here?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2060128043" "Ah, here we go!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3695747102" "I'm on it!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P280541526" "Oh, I see."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1248905116" "Sure sure."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P155098164" "Got it!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P909752526" "You!  How did you get in here?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3280997135" "Not today!"

